.TH TFCHANGES 1
.SH NAME
tfchanges \\- normalize Terraform or OpenTofu plan JSON
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B tfchanges
tfchanges [summary] [--input PLAN.json] [--format json|ndjson]
.br
[--address REGEX] [--module REGEX] [--provider REGEX] [--type REGEX] [--action LIST]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Normalizes Terraform/OpenTofu change records and summary risk facts from plan JSON.
.SH OPTIONS
Use \fBtfchanges --help\fR for the complete, version-specific flag list.
.SH EXIT STATUS
Uses the shared CLI status convention: 0 success, 1 a completed negative finding or policy failure, 2 invalid usage, 3 a partial result, and 4 a runtime failure. Not every status applies to every command.
